message: >-
  Please cite EquWord when referring to this software. Citation in a manuscript
  is appreciated but is not required merely for using the tool. Sharing the
  licensed software remains subject to the attribution conditions of
  CC BY-NC-SA 4.0; see LICENSE.txt. A version DOI will be added when available.
title: "EquWord: Equation Conversion and Formatting for Microsoft Word"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Cho
    given-names: Gyeongcheol
version: 0.9.27
license: CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0
url: "https://github.com/PsycheMatrica/EquWord"
abstract: >-
  A Microsoft Word VBA template for converting supported LaTeX to editable
  native equations and applying document-specific notation and equation-layout
  choices. The tested 0.9.27 template retains its legacy Research Equation
  Formatter filename and macro names.
